      color: #db5145;\n      font-size: 37px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      line-height: 1.1;\n    }\n    .intro-copy {\n      width: 1100px;\n      font-size: 26px;\n      line-height: 1.42;\n    }\n    .intro-copy p { margin: 0; }\n    .objective { margin-top: 66px; }\n    .objective p {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-size: 26px;\n      line-height: 1.4;\n    }\n    .placeholder {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      color: transparent;\n      font-size: 0;\n    }\n    .phone-placeholder {\n      position: absolute;\n      right: 90px;\n      top: 72px;\n      width: 335px;\n      height: 405px;\n    }\n    .phone-placeholder::before {\n      content: \"\";\n      width: 145px;\n      height: 300px;\n      border: 12px solid #333;\n      border-radius: 31px;\n      background: #48b8cd;\n      transform: rotate(-5deg);\n      box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 8px #111;\n    }\n    .phone-placeholder::after {\n      content: \"\";\n      width: 135px;\n      height: 270px;\n      border-radius: 50% 43% 45% 38%;\n      background: #bb704a;\n      position: absolute;\n      right: 18px;\n      bottom: 6px;\n      transform: rotate(-28deg);\n      opacity: .88;\n    }\n    .main {\n      min-height: 1065px;\n      padding: 52px 120px 60px;\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 48% 52%;\n      background: #fff;\n    }\n    .methodology {\n      border-right: 2px solid #ddd;\n      padding-right: 64px;\n    }\n    .methodology ol {\n      margin: 26px 0 0;\n      padding-left: 31px;\n      font-size: 26px;\n      line-height: 1.4;\n    }\n    .methodology > ol > li {\n      padding-left: 0;\n      margin-bottom: 0;\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n    .methodology ol ol {\n      margin: 0;\n      padding-left: 34px;\n      font-weight: 400;\n      list-style-type: lower-alpha;\n    }\n    .methodology li span { font-weight: 400; }\n    .results {\n      padding-left: 85px;\n    }\n    .results p {\n      margin: 25px 0 30px;\n      font-size: 26px;\n      line-height: 1.39;\n      max-width: 650px;\n    }\n    table {\n      width: 680px;\n      margin-top: 27px;\n      border-collapse: collapse;\n      font-size: 24px;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n    thead th {\n      height: 76px;\n      background: #ed3732;\n      color: white;\n      font-size: 24px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n    tbody td {\n      height: 39px;\n      background: #f0f0f0;\n    }\n    tbody tr:nth-child(even) td:not(:first-child) { background: #fff; }\n    tbody td:first-child {\n      width: 306px;\n      background: #46aec2;\n      color: white;\n      font-style: italic;\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n    .table-footer {\n      width: 680px;\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      margin-top: 16px;\n      font-size: 22px;\n      font-style: italic;\n    }\n    .r2 { font-size: 25px; font-weight: 700; }\n    .stars {\n      text-align: right;\n      line-height: 1.25;\n      font-size: 18px;\n    }\n    .conclusion {\n      min-height: 185px;\n      padding: 0 120px 50px;\n      background: #fff;\n    }\n    .conclusion h2 { margin-bottom: 23px; }\n    .conclusion p {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-size: 27px;\n      line-height: 1.4;\n    }\n    footer {\n      min-height: 270px;\n      padding: 73px 120px;\n      background: #000;\n      color: #f5f5f5;\n      font-size: 26px;\n      line-height: 1.6;\n    }\n    footer p { margin: 0; max-width: 1510px; }\n    footer strong { font-weight: 700; }\n    @media (max-width: 1728px) {\n      .poster { width: 100%; min-height: auto; }\n    }\n    @media (max-width: 900px) {\n      .hero, .intro, .main, .conclusion, footer { padding-left: 38px; padding-right: 38px; }\n      .hero { height: auto; padding-top: 68px; }\n      .hero h1 { width: auto; font-size: 37px; }\n      .hero p { font-size: 28px; }\n      .intro { padding-bottom: 300px; }\n      .intro-copy { width: auto; font-size: 20px; }\n      .objective p, .results p, .conclusion p { font-size: 20px; }\n      .phone-placeholder { right: 15px; top: auto; bottom: 0; transform: scale(.7); transform-origin: bottom right; }\n      .main { display: block; }\n      .methodology { border-right: 0; border-bottom: 2px solid #ddd; padding: 0 0 35px; }\n      .results { padding: 40px 0 0; }\n      .methodology ol { font-size: 20px; }\n      table, .table-footer { width: 100%; }\n      table { font-size: 16px; }\n      thead th { font-size: 16px; }\n      footer { font-size: 19px; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"poster\">\n    <section class=\"hero\">\n      <h1>The sales effect of “Free App of the Day”<br>on Amazon Appstore: An empirical study</h1>\n      <p>Hong Chen, Kevin Lachaud, Wenqi Zhou</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"intro\">\n      <h2>INTRODUCTION</h2>\n      <div class=\"intro-copy\">\n        <p>Apps, as an abbreviation of mobile applications, are software products for mobile platforms (Tang, 2016). They are designed to perform certain tasks on mobile devices (Islam, Islam, &amp; Mazumder, 2010). This product category has grown to become a gigantic differentiated market with over 3.48 million apps on Google Play, an app marketplace, and the recent projection of over 935-billion-dollar revenue in 2023 (Statista Research, 2021a, Statista Research, 2021b).</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"objective\">\n        <h2>OBJECTIVE</h2>\n        <p>This work studies the adverse effect of “Free App of the Day” at Amazon Appstore.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder phone-placeholder\">[Image: hand using smartphone]</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"main\">\n      <section class=\"methodology\">\n        <h2>METHODOLOGY</h2>\n        <ol>\n          <li>Literature review\n            <ol>\n              <li><span>Digital free sampling</span></li>\n              <li><span>eWOM</span></li>\n            </ol>\n          </li>\n          <li>Hypotheses\n            <ol>\n              <li><span>H1 - Online user decisions to adopt apps are discouraged by the price rebound after the zero-price offering of FAD ends. The sharper price rebound leads to a greater decrease in app adoptions.</span></li>\n              <li><span>H2 - Conditional on the total volume of eWOM, organic reviews are more influential to online user decisions of adopting apps than promotion-induced reviews after the FAD promotion ends.</span></li>\n            </ol>\n          </li>\n          <li>Data\n            <ol>\n              <li><span>Context and data collection</span></li>\n              <li><span>Key variables</span></li>\n            </ol>\n          </li>\n          <li>Empirical analysis\n            <ol>\n              <li><span>Exploratory analysis</span></li>\n              <li><span>Regression model and results</span></li>\n            </ol>\n          </li>\n        </ol>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"results\">\n        <h2>RESULTS</h2>\n        <p>We notice that a few apps were off the direct spotlight post-promotion; however, they still offer zero price for another one or two days.<br>Specifically, an increase in SkewDailyi indicates a more right skewed distribution of daily number of reviews during the post-promotion period.</p>\n\n        <table aria-label=\"Regression results\">\n          <thead>\n            <tr>\n              <th>Empty Cell</th>\n              <th>Mean</th>\n              <th>S.D.</th>\n            </tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr><td>PriceReboundi,t</td><td>−0.40***</td><td>0.06</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>SkewDailyi</td><td>−0.19*</td><td>0.11</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>KurtDdailyi</td><td>−0.09**</td><td>0.05</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>Ln(NumReviewsi,t)</td><td>0.59***</td><td>0.08</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>AverageRatingi,t</td><td>2.06***</td><td>0.40</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>VarianceRatingi,t</td><td>1.17***</td><td>0.30</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>Dayi,t</td><td>−0.11*</td><td>0.03</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>Agei,t</td><td>−0.0004***</td><td>0.0002</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>AppSizei,t</td><td>0.01***</td><td>0.002</td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n        <div class=\"table-footer\">\n          <div class=\"r2\">R2 = 0.45</div>\n          <div class=\"stars\">* p &lt; 0.1.<br>**p &lt; 0.05.<br>***p &lt; 0.01.</div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"conclusion\">\n      <h2>CONCLUSION</h2>\n      <p>We conclude that these promotion-induced reviews are less influential than organic reviews.</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <footer>\n      <p><strong>References:</strong> Chen, H., Lachaud, K. and Zhou, W., 2022. The sales effect of “Free App of the Day” on Amazon Appstore: An empirical study. Digital Business, 2(2), p.100020.</p>\n    </footer>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
